msgstr "De controller is volledig uit en gereset."

#: ../../library/pyb.CAN.rst:430
msgid ""
"The controller is on and in the Error Active state (both TEC and REC are "
"less than 96)."
msgstr ""
"De controller is aan en in de Error Active-toestand (zowel TEC als REC zijn "
"kleiner dan 96)."

#: ../../library/pyb.CAN.rst:436
msgid ""
"The controller is on and in the Error Warning state (at least one of TEC or "
"REC is 96 or greater)."
msgstr ""
"De controller is aan en in de Error Warning-toestand (ten minste een van TEC"
" of REC is 96 of hoger)."

#: ../../library/pyb.CAN.rst:442
msgid ""
"The controller is on and in the Error Passive state (at least one of TEC or "
"REC is 128 or greater)."
msgstr ""
"De controller is aan en in de Error Passive-toestand (ten minste een van TEC"
" of REC is 128 of hoger)."

#: ../../library/pyb.CAN.rst:448
